<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="/Assets/UI/widgets/widgets.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="/Assets/UI/demo.rcss"/>
    <style>
        .music-panel { width: 320dp; }
        .music-now { font-size: 22dp; color: #f8fafc; margin: 8dp 0 2dp 0; }
        .music-bar { font-size: 14dp; color: #93c5fd; font-family: "Roboto Mono"; }
        .music-next { font-size: 13dp; color: #fbbf24; min-height: 18dp; margin-bottom: 6dp; }
        .music-panel button.hit { box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; margin-top: 8dp; border-color: #fbbf2499; color: #fde68a; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="hud" data-model="adaptive">
    <div class="demo-panel music-panel">
        <h1>Adaptive music</h1>
        <p class="hint">A song from the editor's music mode, baked to stems. The game sets two parameters; the music follows on the beat.</p>
        <p class="music-now">{{section}}</p>
        <p class="music-bar">bar {{bar}}.{{beat}}</p>
        <p class="music-next"><span data-if="pending != ''">Next: {{pending}} in {{seconds | format(1)}} s</span></p>
        <div class="demo-row"><span>Intensity</span><input type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" data-value="intensity"/></div>
        <p class="hint">Fades the percussion in, then the lead, opening its filter.</p>
        <div class="demo-row"><span>Area</span>
            <select data-value="area"><option value="0">Calm</option><option value="1">Combat</option></select></div>
        <p class="hint">Combat starts at the next bar; back to Calm plays the Hit stinger.</p>
        <button class="hit" data-event-click="hit()">Hit stinger</button>
        <div class="demo-row"><span>Music</span><input type="checkbox" data-checked="music"/></div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
